          "title": "Banco Macro",
          "text": "15% OFF en 1 pago o hasta 12 cuotas sin interés con Visa y Mastercard."
        },
        {
          "image": "https://mundofixar.vtexassets.com/assets/vtex.file-manager-graphql/images/e1a73f05-684f-4906-bb3f-83ee56681b17___39df9ec765b34d504e26fb90605c5a8d.png",
          "title": "Banco Francés",
          "text": "15% OFF en 1 pago o hasta 12 cuotas sin interés con Visa y Mastercard."
        },
        {
          "image": "https://mundofixar.vtexassets.com/assets/vtex.file-manager-graphql/images/98df384c-e2af-4cbd-ba1c-835d755fc10b___037ad4b7c20cfb21b054d996572bc3b3.png",
          "title": "Go Cuotas",
